<title>USA: Arrow Electronics files $500 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Arrow Electronics files $500 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arrow Electronics Inc said Wednesday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $500 million in debt securities.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said in the filing.</p>
<p>Arrow Electronics, of Melville, New York, is a distributor of electronic components and computer products to industrial and commercial customers.</p>
</text>
